From k249: when chat_f rewrites a forced tool_choice into response_format json_schema (engine lacks tool_choice_named), it sets a per-request response_format that replaces one the caller passed per request or set on the engine — silently. Decide: croak when both a forced tool and a (non-text) response_format are given on a rewriting engine (the two intents conflict), or carp and let the forced tool win. Test on Perplexity + Ollama native + NousResearch.

